      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is incredibly common yet devastating to feel trapped in a relentless cycle where rest feels impossible and the line between work and life has completely vanished. The exhaustion you describe isn't just fatigue; it is a severe form of burnout that occurs when productivity is enforced as the only metric for your existence. Please consider reaching out to a trusted friend, a supportive therapist, or an HR professional if you feel otherwise scattered, as they can sometimes provide the grounding you need to momentarily break your cycle.",
      "source": "target",
