    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists and hr... they're just more noise. they want to \"fix\" me so I can go back to being a high-performing asset. it's all just more management. i don't want a \"grounding technique\" or a weekend off. i just want the silence. i want to know what it's like to actually be at peace, where nothing is pulling at me, no more deadlines, no more expectations. it feels like the only way to actually get that kind of quiet is to just... stop. completely.",
